   "kind": "field_value",
   "field_name": "Headline",
   "text": "Momcozy® Official",
   "anchor": "#广告文案明细/recvuJYdObLAH7/Headline"
  },
  {
   "kind": "field_value",
   "field_name": "Primary Text",
   "text": "Momcozy® Official | Hospital-Grade at Home | -300 mmHg Strong Suction | True Hospital-Strength Power | Wearable Hospital Pump | 3rd-Gen Motor Performance | Shop the V1 Pro Today | Empty Faster, Pump Less | Boost Your Milk Supply | 28% More Milk With DoubleFit™ | Lean Back & Pump in Comfort | Momcozy CA | Pump While You Multitask | Lightweight In-Bra Cups | V1 Pro Sale – Save Today | Clinical 3rd-gen motor. DoubleFit™ flange clinically shown to boost output by 28.2%. | Limited deals on the V1 Pro hospital-grade wearable. 30-day returns + 1-yr warranty. | Hospital-grade suction + wearable freedom. Finally, both in one pump. | Slim teardrop cups sit hidden in your bra. Carry the motor in your pocket just 48dB quiet",
   "anchor": "#广告文案明细/recvuJYdObLAH7/Primary Text"
  },
  {
   "kind": "field_value",
   "field_name": "修改建议",
   "text": "删除 more milk/增产催奶/催产素/长期奶量/裸奶阵排空承诺；合规替代为放松叙事+限定语，如 relaxation supports your natural let-down, which may help your flow（因为放松，自然奶阵可能更顺畅），只描述自然生理过程、不承诺产品带来结果；faster let-down/提高排空效率在拿到W1自身对照数据前禁用 ▸ 效果百分比/销量/评分声称需附测试来源与口径，否则删除（折扣百分比不在此列） ▸ hospital/NICU 场景表述需事实依据，否则删除 ▸ hospital/medical grade 需认证依据，否则删除 ▸ 吸力表述改客观参数（up to -300 mmHg、15 adjustable levels），删除 maximum/strongest",
   "anchor": "#广告文案明细/recvuJYdObLAH7/修改建议"
  },
  {
   "kind": "field_value",
   "field_name": "命中原因",
   "text": "H02 催乳/增产/奶量产出承诺（含裸 more milk、催产素、长期奶量、裸奶阵/排空功效claim，无 FDA/临床证据）；放松叙事+限定语（natural let-down/may help）走 M07 语境守卫；M03 未标注来源的效果数据声明；U03 涉及医院/NICU 场景，需核实临床适用性声明；M05 等级背书用语（需核实是否有对应认证）；M02 吸力夸大用语（建议改为客观档位描述）",
